{"ticker":"VMC","updated":"2026-10-24T00:25:30Z","profile":{"longName":"Vulcan Materials Company","shortName":"Vulcan Materials Company (Holdi","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Building Materials","country":"United States","website":"https://www.vulcanmaterials.com","fullTimeEmployees":11548,"marketCap":33909458944,"trailingPE":30.39373,"forwardPE":25.594507,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.1782026,"pegRatio":1.81,"targetMeanPrice":308.30435,"targetHighPrice":365.0,"targetLowPrice":238.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.025,"earningsGrowth":0.027,"grossMargins":0.27506,"operatingMargins":0.21611,"profitMargins":0.13748,"totalRevenue":8115800064,"beta":1.046,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":331.09,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":237.03,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.77},"summary":"Vulcan Materials Company produces and supplies construction aggregates in the United States. It operates through three segments: Aggregates, Asphalt, and Concrete. The company provides crushed stone, sand and gravel, sand, and other aggregates for use in construction and maintenance of highways, streets, and other public works, as well as in the construction of housing and commercial, industrial, and other nonresidential facilities; aggregates that are used as ballast for construction and maintenance of railroad tracks; riprap and jetty stones for use in erosion control along roads and waterways; asphalt mix; asphalt construction paving services; and ready-mixed concrete products. The company was formerly known as Virginia Holdco, Inc. and changed its name to Vulcan Materials Company. Vulcan Materials Company was founded in 1909 and is headquartered in Birmingham, Alabama.","summary_zh":"Vulcan Materials Company 在美國生產和供應建築骨材。它透過三個部分運作：骨材、瀝青和混凝土。該公司提供碎石、砂石、沙子和其他骨料，用於公路、街道和其他公共工程的建設和維護，以及住房和商業、工業和其他非住宅設施的建設；用作鐵路軌道建設和維護的道碴的骨料；用於控制道路和水道侵蝕的拋石和碼頭石；瀝青混合料；瀝青施工鋪路服務；和預預混凝土產品。該公司原名為 Virginia Holdco, Inc.，後來更名為 Vulcan Materials Company。 Vulcan